WEBVTT

00:01:56.660 --> 00:01:58.590
Thunder god strike!

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:03.780
Is this the place?

00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:05.620
Most likely.

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:21.640
Koyuki-senpai.

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:24.080
What is it?

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:25.960
Can I get up?

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:28.310
<i>They've gone.</i>

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:30.650
Then I guess it's OK.

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:35.310
What was that, Senpai?

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:42.950
I was just about to get serious, and you tell me to play dead?

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:51.830
When I did my divination I saw both you and myself lying on the ground in the forest.

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:58.120
If that's going to be the result,
then there's no point in resisting, is there?

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:01.810
But won't something terrible happen if we don't stop them?

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:03.470
There's still time.

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:06.400
Let's wait for our trump card to come.

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:20.000
<b>The Magic of Happiness</b>

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:25.810
<i>Li Astim Astim.</i>

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:34.970
Ibuki-san has finally made it through.

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:35.730
But...

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:40.250
I can't leave here now.

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:42.680
Everyone, I'm counting on you.

00:03:44.150 --> 00:03:46.590
This is it, I'm sure.

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.780
Let's go, Shinya!

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:50.940
Yes, Ibuki-sama.

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:57.300
Yuuma-kun?

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.680
What should we do, Senpai?

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:03.400
Seal them in?

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:05.530
That's...

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:07.020
I'm sorry,

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:11.560
but I need you to leave this place now.

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:13.770
Saya-san?

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:18.020
Ibuki-sama!

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:21.150
That's it.

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:24.980
We've finally found it.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.330
<i>Ludo Re Dragna!</i>

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:38.260
The seal in the Shiki Forest has been broken.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.410
It is as you've heard.

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:45.900
If necessary, this time I shall...

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:49.650
That is my duty as the head of the Shikimori.

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:51.760
Don't rush to conclusions.

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:53.730
Let's wait a while longer.

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.620
Yuzuha-dono...

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:09.490
At last!  At last I have the treasure!

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:12.570
Congratulations, Ibuki-sama.

00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:15.300
You have finally attained your goal.

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:17.420
No, not yet.

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:19.640
It's just beginning.

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:24.840
With the power of the treasure, my true desire will be realized!

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:27.730
Ibuki-sama, you can't mean-!

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:34.230
Ibuki-sama is making the same mistake as my father.

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:37.220
If you know that, then why don't you stop her?!

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:47.590
All we two can do now is to sacrifice ourselves so that her mistake does not cause harm to others.

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:50.860
It's not necessary for you to do anything.

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:55.290
Taking care of this is our duty.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:01.210
Please stop, Ibuki-sama!

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:09.480
Everybody's looking for you, Yuuma!

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:11.250
Hachi...

00:06:11.610 --> 00:06:14.180
Really, you found him?

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:17.110
<i>Vana Daguel Phina.</i>

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:20.600
<i>Agdol Zeus Leina Vodos Cel!</i>

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:26.000
Treasure of the Shikimori,
bring back Natsune-neesama!

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:36.000
Natsune-neesama!

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:58.680
<i>Anri-sama!</i>

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:00.020
What is this?

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:01.880
Is the treasure...?

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:03.800
It's going out of control!

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:06.880
Wh-What the heck?

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:12.740
The head of the Shikimori family can use the power of the treasure to command the souls of the dead.

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:14.310
They are known as the Shiki.

00:07:14.310 --> 00:07:17.780
This forest is where they sleep.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:23.770
Complete mastery of the treasure enables one to revive the dead.

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:31.630
But, if it goes out of control, it will unleash a plague of uncontrollable demons upon the earth.

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:42.470
Yuuma!

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:43.400
Hachi!

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:47.340
Hachi, good work finding him so fast.

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:49.640
It's my male intuition.

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:53.750
That's Takamizu Hachisuke, a man who can be relied on in a pinch!

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:54.780
Yuuma-kun!

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:59.340
Yuuma-kun!

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:00.640
Haruhi...

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:03.380
I'm sorry to worry you.

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:06.290
Minagi-sensei is watching over Sumomo-chan.

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:08.250
There's nothing to worry about.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.400
I see...

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:10.570
What the hell is that?!

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:13.910
It's near the school!

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:18.320
Oh no!  The treasure of the Shikimori has gone out of control?

00:08:19.340 --> 00:08:20.270
Impossible!

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.700
This shouldn't be happening!

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:26.720
Natsune-neesama!

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:30.040
<i>Vana Daguel Phina.</i>

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:33.510
<i>Agdol Zeus Leina Vodos Cel!</i>

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:42.980
I need to control it!

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:45.290
I'm going to see Natsune-neesama!

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:50.920
Ibuki-sama!

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:53.520
Shinya!

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:05.400
This is the problem of the Shikimori family and their servants.

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:07.500
You two please run away.

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:09.510
Not a chance.

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:10.700
It's too late for that.

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:12.990
I'm not backing down now.

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.100
But...

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:19.420
And you don't get to beat the crap out of a horde of demons every day.

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:21.240
Tama-chan, let's go!

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:24.000
<i>Right, miss!</i>

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.930
Hiiragi-san, Koyuki-san...

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:32.300
Come with me, Yuuma-kun.

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:36.240
We need your power to stop this.

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:37.710
Mine?

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:40.180
The power of your magic.

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:45.620
My magic brings disaster to those around me.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:48.090
I can't use it.

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:55.030
I used it, and it tore me apart from my real mother.

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:57.990
And Sumomo, too... That was my fault.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:06.210
My magic is the magic of misery.

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:14.060
Yuuma-kun...

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:27.540
<i>Phantasia, Third Movement.  Arrow of Heaven's Will!</i>

00:10:31.350 --> 00:10:32.780
Tama-chan, go!

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:34.230
<i>Aye-aye, sir!</i>

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:39.610
<i>Lei Phrahel Oais Sevet Oesque!</i>

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:52.710
As I thought, our only hope is to seal the treasure itself again.

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:56.960
<i>But, miss, we'll never get close to it like this.</i>

00:10:56.960 --> 00:11:00.890
What is this awful feeling I have?

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:03.840
If something happened to my brother...

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:07.590
Shinya, wake up!

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:09.510
Shinya!

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:11.890
<i>Ibuki-sama, this barrier won't last...</i>

00:11:11.890 --> 00:11:13.340
I know!

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:20.190
F-Forget about me...

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:22.480
S-Silence!

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:24.340
I don't want to hear things like that!

00:11:28.690 --> 00:11:33.690
If I use magic, the people around me will become miserable.

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:35.980
This time, too.  I'm sure of it.

00:11:35.980 --> 00:11:38.030
That's not true.

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:39.320
Haruhi?

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:43.210
Your magic has made people happy, too.

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:46.150
That can't be true.

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:49.210
I've only used it in front of other people once.

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:53.160
Have you forgotten about the girl you saved?

00:11:54.450 --> 00:12:01.510
She learned what a wonderful thing magic was,
and started to study to become a mage that very day.

00:12:01.510 --> 00:12:09.320
And she came to Mizuhosaka Academy, and met so many wonderful friends...

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:12.140
And she met you again!

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:15.750
And she's happy every day now...

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:16.960
Haruhi?

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:18.660
That's right.

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:20.930
I was that girl!

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:26.580
Your magic made me happy.

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:29.310
I'm sure you can make others happy as well.

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:32.050
So, please...

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:36.350
But I can't control my power.

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:38.170
Even if I go...

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:39.890
Use my flute.

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:41.680
Flute?

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:47.280
I heard a flute...

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:48.950
A flute?

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:51.220
Hey, it's glowing!

00:13:00.010 --> 00:13:03.770
Minagi-sensei said to give this to you.

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:27.080
So Minagi-sensei is my mother?

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:29.410
Seriously?

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:31.300
How did you know?

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:36.700
The soul of the woman sealed inside this flute told me.

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:40.540
<i>Li Astim Astim.</i>

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:48.870
Ten years ago, Natsune died to stop the treasure.

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:51.350
But that won't happen this time.

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:55.460
Yuuma-kun, if you use your magic...

00:13:55.880 --> 00:13:59.700
Haruhi, do you really think I can do it?

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:04.620
It's OK.

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:07.680
You can do it.

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:10.510
Be strong.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.490
Haruhi...

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:26.480
I'll...

00:14:26.480 --> 00:14:27.860
...try.

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.800
<i>Phantasia, Second Movement.</i>

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:42.750
<i>Palace of the Bright Mirror!</i>

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:54.390
<i>Di Eldras Leola!</i>

00:14:56.020 --> 00:14:58.320
<i>Miss, they're trying to leave the forest!</i>

00:14:58.320 --> 00:14:59.780
Oh dear!

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:02.280
If we can't stop them, they'll go after innocent people!

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:12.110
<i>El Amdelt Els Di Aftam Adaphalas!</i>

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:18.490
<i>El Amstia Laruseirus!</i>

00:15:18.490 --> 00:15:20.840
<i>Di Latile Amarest!</i>

00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:24.090
We're here.

00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:26.660
Kamisaka-sama!  Kohinata-sama!

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:27.520
You're late!

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:30.500
Just as planned.

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:55.480
The demons...

00:15:57.590 --> 00:15:59.190
Yuuma-kun...

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:26.020
Ibuki-sama!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:29.550
Is this the end?

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:33.030
If I could only see Natsune-neesama...

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.580
That flute!

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:50.550
Kohinata Yuuma?

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:17.590
Holy hell, that guy's huge!

00:17:36.190 --> 00:17:39.060
Can we defeat something so big?

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:40.760
It's all right.

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:43.000
Give me your power, everyone!

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:44.600
OK!

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:03.810
<i>Vel Amal Eles.</i>

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:07.210
Haruhi?

00:18:07.860 --> 00:18:10.170
<i>Vio Li Vede Da Velna.</i>

00:18:10.590 --> 00:18:14.120
<i>Lu Bin Shan Sel.</i>

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:17.540
<i>On El Mesas Luk Arsas.</i>

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:22.030
<i>Estarius Auk Shian Sem.</i>

00:18:19.710 --> 00:18:24.480
<i>El Amisia Misa No Kero Shian Kam.</i>

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:26.490
<i>Second Movement.  Sparkle of the Fairies!</i>

00:18:38.440 --> 00:18:39.740
What happened?

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:40.630
Yuuma-kun!

00:18:41.270 --> 00:18:43.790
He needs just a bit more power.

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:47.690
If he tries to seal the treasure like this...

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:57.960
If he tries to seal the treasure like this, he'll have to sacrifice his own life.

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:01.380
I have no choice?

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:06.480
Kohinata Yuuma!

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:08.350
Take my power...

00:19:08.350 --> 00:19:10.020
Take my power!

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:20.080
<i>El Amralt Di Els.</i>

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:23.740
<i>Leyte Wiole.</i>

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:26.110
<i>Tera Vistom!</i>

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:34.810
<i>Cal a Lat Liara Kartiae!</i>

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:37.450
<i>Dei El Qona!</i>

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:00.760
Is it over?

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:02.060
Yes.

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:11.700
Take this.

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:23.050
Natsune-neesama?

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:32.440
I... just... wanted to see you once more...

00:20:33.010 --> 00:20:34.390
Thank you.

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:36.170
I always wanted to see you, too.

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:43.360
But there are many people around you who treasure you just as much as I do.

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:47.820
So now I want you to treasure them as well.

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:49.020
All right?

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:54.010
Yes, Sister...

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:09.500
I guess it's over.

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:15.700
Sumomo-chan, don't go...

00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:20.010
I'll make croquettes filled with love...

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:22.470
Next time they'll be curry flavored...

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:29.250
So pretty!

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:35.520
I wonder if my brother and Ibuki-chan are watching.

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:41.750
<i>And that's how it was.</i>

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:46.470
I knew it.  That's what my divination told me.  That it'd go well in the end.

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:48.420
Jeez, tell us that first.

00:21:48.420 --> 00:21:49.720
Sorry, sorry.

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:51.680
Here's your scotch that I brought back as a present.

00:21:51.680 --> 00:21:52.960
Oh well, fine.

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:56.030
Tama-chan, tell us what happened to everybody after that?

00:21:56.030 --> 00:21:57.150
<i>You got it!</i>

00:23:28.180 --> 00:23:30.710
Yuuma's transferring into the School of Magic?

00:23:30.710 --> 00:23:32.710
Didn't you know, Hachi?

00:23:32.710 --> 00:23:34.980
Everybody knew that a long time ago.

00:23:40.220 --> 00:23:44.280
Go into a trance and try to calm your heart.

00:23:44.890 --> 00:23:46.350
Try your hardest!

00:23:49.640 --> 00:23:52.720
I guess it's hard to get the first time.

00:24:07.070 --> 00:24:08.160
Sorry.

00:24:08.630 --> 00:24:11.400
Jeez, you tried too hard.

00:24:12.360 --> 00:24:13.670
But...

00:24:14.700 --> 00:24:17.490
That made me just a bit happy.
